      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm an HR manager for a remote software team and I need to put together a quick memo for the staff about workstation ergonomics. Can you help me draft something that covers the basics like monitor height, chair support, and why it's important to take breaks so people don't get wrist or back pain? Just keep it professional and easy to read.",
